message: >-
  Cite a specific edition: give its identifier (for example 2026-09-15_2026-10-15-r1)
  and the SHA-256 of its data/editions/<edition>/catalog.json. An edition is a
  dated description of recorded accesses, not a timeless result. r1 is publicly
  accessible and frozen; r2 is a distinct local correction candidate. No independent
  scientific review is documented. Cite the exact code commit for software and the
  edition identifier plus content manifest for data; no DOI is assigned.
title: "Dual Web Reference: governance files, relations and recorded accesses on three sites"
